@startuml design-1-camadas
title Controle de Gastos — Design (vista 1): camadas e dependências
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #444444
}

package "androidApp / iosApp / webApp\n<size:10>pontos de entrada de cada plataforma</size>" as plat #F7F7F5 {
}

package "composeApp / commonMain" as common {
  package "ui\n<size:10>telas Compose + ViewModels</size>" as ui #FFFFFF {
  }
  package "application\n<size:10>casos de uso (Controllers GRASP)</size>" as app #FFFFFF {
  }
  package "domain" as dom #EEF4FB {
    package "model\n<size:10>entidades e valores</size>" as model {
    }
    package "regra\n<size:10>Strategy, Factory, exceções</size>" as regra {
    }
    package "repositorio\n<size:10>interfaces</size>" as repo {
    }
  }
  package "data\n<size:10>Room KMP: entidades, DAOs, repositórios</size>" as data #FFFFFF {
  }
  package "di\n<size:10>módulos Koin</size>" as di #FFFFFF {
  }
}

plat -down-> ui
ui -down-> app
app -down-> model
app -down-> regra
app -down-> repo
regra -right-> model
repo -left-> model
data -up-> repo : implementa
data -up-> model
di ..> ui
di ..> app
di ..> data

note as N1
  O domínio não depende de nenhuma outra camada
  nem de framework (sem Room, Compose ou Koin)  [RNF07]
end note
note as N2
  Persistência substituível: trocar Room por outra
  implementação (ex.: Web) não altera domain/application
end note
N1 .. dom
N2 .. data
@enduml
